<title>USA: Omaha cattle up $.50/1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up $.50/1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were $.50-1.00 higher. - USDA</p>
<p>Steers: Select to Choice 2-4, 1100-1300 lbs 66.00-67.50.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4, 1000-1250 lbs 65.00-67.00.</p>
</text>
